      "content": "that's a good start, really sets the mood. to make it even more visceral, can u zoom in on some of those people lurking in the shadows? i want to get a better sense of the archetypes—the types of guys you'd see hanging out on the corners or moving through the alleys that make a person want to keep their head down and keep walking. just give me a few descriptive snippets of what they look and act like so i can picture them.",
